# Testing

Full guide: `docs/testing.md`.

- Prefer sociable tests with real `OrdersService`, tools, and in-memory store.
- Double only the LLM via `MockLanguageModelV3` / `src/testing/mock-language-model.ts`.
- Assert HTTP status/body, store contents, tool return values — not model prose or `toHaveBeenCalledWith` on internals.
- Do not mock tools inside agent tests or `OrdersService` inside tool tests.
- Default CI must not call live providers; `LIVE_LLM_TEST=1` only when explicitly requested.
- UI browser tests: `examples/chat-ui/e2e` — demo fixture by default (`docs/lessons/05-playwright-ui-tests.md`).
